. estimates store model1

. 
. * 生成残差、拟合值
. predict yhat, xb                 // 拟合值

. predict residuals, residuals     // 残差

. gen residuals2   = residuals^2   // 残差平方

. gen absresid     = abs(residuals) // 残差绝对值

. 
. * ============================================================
. * 2. 诊断图
. * ============================================================
. * 2.1 残差 vs 拟合值（喇叭状 → 异方差）
. graph twoway (scatter residuals yhat, msymbol(oh) msize(small))        (lfit 
> residuals yhat, lcolor(cranberry) lwidth(medium)),        title("Residuals vs
>  Fitted")        xtitle("Fitted values") ytitle("Residuals")        name(g1, 
> replace)

. 
. * 2.2 残差平方 vs 拟合值
. graph twoway (scatter residuals2 yhat, msymbol(oh) msize(small))        (lfit
>  residuals2 yhat, lcolor(edkblue) lwidth(medium)),        title("Residual^2 v
> s Fitted")        xtitle("Fitted values") ytitle("Residual^2")        name(g2
> , replace)

. 
. * 2.3 残差平方 vs 对数产出 lnq（常体现方差随规模变化）
. graph twoway (scatter residuals2 lnq, msymbol(oh) msize(small))        (lfit 
> residuals2 lnq, lcolor(green) lwidth(medium)),        title("Residual^2 vs ln
> q")        xtitle("lnq") ytitle("Residual^2")        name(g3, replace)

. 
. * 合成一张诊断图
. graph combine g1 g2 g3, title("异方差诊断图")        name(het_diag, replace) 
> ysize(4) xsize(6)

. 
. * ============================================================
. * 3. 异方差检验（五种方法）
. * ============================================================
. di _n "================= 异方差检验 ================="

================= 异方差检验 =================

. 
. * ============================================================
. * 检验一：Breusch-Pagan 检验
. * 原假设 H0: 同方差；p<0.05 → 拒绝 H0，存在异方差
. * ============================================================
. di _n "--- 检验一: Breusch-Pagan 检验 ---"

--- 检验一: Breusch-Pagan 检验 ---

. estat hettest, iid

Breusch–Pagan/Cook–Weisberg test for heteroskedasticity 
Assumption: i.i.d. error terms
Variable: Fitted values of lntc

H0: Constant variance

    chi2(1) =  29.13
Prob > chi2 = 0.0000

. 
. * ============================================================
. * 检验二：White 检验（最稳健，含交叉项与平方项）
. * ============================================================
. di _n "--- 检验二: White 检验 ---"

--- 检验二: White 检验 ---

. estat imtest, white

White's test
H0: Homoskedasticity
Ha: Unrestricted heteroskedasticity

   chi2(14) =  73.88
Prob > chi2 = 0.0000

Cameron & Trivedi's decomposition of IM-test

--------------------------------------------------
              Source |       chi2     df         p
---------------------+----------------------------
  Heteroskedasticity |      73.88     14    0.0000
            Skewness |      22.79      4    0.0001
            Kurtosis |       2.62      1    0.1055
---------------------+----------------------------
               Total |      99.29     19    0.0000
--------------------------------------------------

. 
. * ============================================================
. * 检验三：Goldfeld-Quandt 检验
. * 按某变量(此处用 lnq)排序，舍去中间样本，比较前后两段残差方差
. * ============================================================
. di _n "--- 检验三: Goldfeld-Quandt 检验 ---"

--- 检验三: Goldfeld-Quandt 检验 ---

. gsort lnq

. gen order = _n

. local c = int(_N/4)                                    // 中间舍弃的样本数

. qui regress lntc lnq lnpl lnpk lnpf if order <= (_N - _N/2)/2     // 前半段

. scalar rss1 = e(rss)

. scalar n1   = e(df_r)

. qui regress lntc lnq lnpl lnpk lnpf if order >  (_N + _N/2)/2     // 后半段

. scalar rss2 = e(rss)

. scalar n2   = e(df_r)

. scalar F_gq = (rss2/n2) / (rss1/n1)

. scalar p_gq = Ftail(n2, n1, F_gq)

. di "前半段残差方差 = " %10.4f rss1/n1
前半段残差方差 =     0.3201

. di "后半段残差方差 = " %10.4f rss2/n2
后半段残差方差 =     0.0242

. di "F 统计量      = " %6.3f F_gq
F 统计量      =  0.076

. di "p值           = " %6.4f p_gq
p值           = 1.0000

. di "结论: " cond(p_gq < 0.05, "拒绝 H0，存在异方差", "不能拒绝 H0，视为同方差
> ")
结论: 不能拒绝 H0，视为同方差

. 
. * ============================================================
. * 检验四：Glejser 检验
. * 用 |残差| 对解释变量回归，考察其显著性
. * ============================================================
. di _n "--- 检验四: Glejser 检验 ---"

--- 检验四: Glejser 检验 ---

. qui regress absresid lnq lnpl lnpk lnpf

. test lnq lnpl lnpk lnpf

 ( 1)  lnq = 0
 ( 2)  lnpl = 0
 ( 3)  lnpk = 0
 ( 4)  lnpf = 0

       F(  4,   140) =   16.30
            Prob > F =    0.0000

. di "结论: " cond(r(p) < 0.05, "拒绝 H0，存在异方差", "不能拒绝 H0，视为同方差
> ")
结论: 拒绝 H0，存在异方差

. 
. * ============================================================
. * 检验五：Spearman 秩相关检验
. * 对 |残差| 与各解释变量做 Spearman 秩相关，显著则存在异方差
. * ============================================================
. di _n "--- 检验五: Spearman 秩相关检验 ---"

--- 检验五: Spearman 秩相关检验 ---

. spearman absresid lnq lnpl lnpk lnpf, star(0.05)

